-- ===== placements =====
-- the Scholars' Breach (comp 2): the entry hall at z 0, Aldra in the middle, the stair down at the
-- round room at the end of the south corridor
-- the Lyceum (comp 1): floor z -6. Since 2026-09-29 a quiet ruin: the brood keeps to the hive below. Four
-- Empyrean Record Cases hold the Lyceum Record Shards Aldra asks for; the Brood Seal in the Binding Hall
-- (the 3 x 3 centre) opens onto the Breached Hive.
-- 0x003F's other halls (the stone hive of comp 0 and the Wellspring hall of comp 4) are left empty: no
-- portal leads there any more.

-- ===== THE BREACHED HIVE 0x003E: the brood beside the retail Olthoi =====
-- Every point is a tile centre ray-cast for a floor (floor_ok); 'r' is the distance to the nearest retail row.
-- the north tunnel (z -12): the Brood Seal's landing and the way back up (r 19-21)
-- packs: the upper brood chamber (z -30, r 13-35), the south-west tunnels (z -12), the east galleries (z -18,
-- z -24), and the rooms round the Branding Pit (z -30)
-- the Branding Pit: the west alcove off the middle chamber (z -36 and its step at -33, r 110), the First
-- Branded and the Wellspring Gate down the old well-shaft to the nest. The first pick, the stepped shaft room
-- in the south, has floors in its MESH at z -30/-24 but none in its physics: a bot teleported there fell to
-- -42, and so did the First Branded. Every point below was stood on by a bot (WHERE) on 2026-09-29.
-- the great hall (z -42, vaulted to -6): the Queen, with the retail Olthoi Piercers and a Noble who already
-- guard it; clutches, an egg sac, a shed carapace and an acid pit, the way retail dressed its own queen's lair
-- (0xE6D3). Every point stood on by a bot; she was @created here to prove she fits.
-- the old nest at the bottom of the hive (z -48), among retail Engorged Eaters: two more clutches
-- clutches in the upper brood chamber (z -30) and the east alcove across from the pit (z -36, r 100)
